zM1NjgwMDM=', 'text': '@RepThomasMassie just posted about this earlier today in the context of air traffic control technology (https://t.co/UWzauFhUhX) and he\'s 100% correct.  You can\'t be afraid of change and risk if you want to troubleshoot problems.  \nAdditionally, @thatsKAIZEN recently posted about this exact term of "settled science" (https://t.co/LzniL54KsG) and he\'s also 💯 correct.  There\'s no such thing as "settled science."  Science is an ongoing inquiry without bias towards the results.  \nIf this public servant wants to speak about risks that we can ill afford, then she is barking up the wrong tree.  She defines "risk" very poorly by suggesting that RFKJ is a danger to the HHS system and to us.  \nUntil any democrat can show why RFKJ\'s focus (chronic disease, quality food supply, and restoring the focus to regulation) is somehow guiding us in the wrong direction, then they are not worth listening to.  Full stop.  \nIn lieu of that, I will conclude that it is they who are standing in the way of "moving forward." \nTo mirror a favorite phrase of yours @TheDemocrats: let\'s turn the page😉', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [{'display_url': 'x.com/RepThomasMassi…', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/RepThomasMassie/status/1885017091964637558', 'url': 'https://t.co/UWzauFhUhX', 'indices': [104, 127]}, {'display_url': 'x.com/MauRhym/status…', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/MauRhym/status/1884668318675513622', 'url': 'https://t.co/LzniL54KsG', 'indices': [319, 342]}], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '975200486', 'name': 'Thomas Massie', 'screen_name': 'RepThomasMassie', 'indices': [0, 16]}, {'id_str': '282419632', 'name': 'Kaizen D. Asiedu', 'screen_name': 'thatsKAIZEN', 'indices': [246, 258]}, {'id_str': '14377605', 'name': 'Democrats', 'screen_name': 'TheDemocrats', 'indices': [1050, 1063]}]}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': []}, 'media': {'inline_media': []}}}}, 'quoted_status_result': {'result': {'__typename': 'Tweet', 'rest_id': '188501709